{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"[color=#FF0000][b]Đây là những tài liệu VIP, chúng tôi đã kỳ công biên tập (hoặc mua .CBL bên Trung Quốc với giá không hề thấp).\r\nChúng tôi bán lại file với một mức chi phí hợp lý để duy trì hoạt động của Web Cờ Tướng.\r\nRất mong mọi người không đăng tải công khai những tài liệu này lên mạng xã hội.\r\nNếu bạn cần mua những tài liệu VIP khác, vui lòng liên hệ\r\nhttps://m.me/tieututhichco hoặc số điện thoại: 093.365.8383\r\nCảm ơn sự ủng hộ của các bạn![/b][/color]\r\n\r\n\r\n2001年8月18日至19日，“富豪山庄杯”第四届华东华南特级大师对抗赛在广东番禺斗阵弄法。经抽签，18日首轮吕钦对胡荣华、许银川对徐天红，19日第二轮徐天红对吕钦、胡荣华对许银川。比赛只记团体总分，若打平则加赛快棋，直至分出胜负。结果华南队以2.5比1.5击败华东队，第四次蝉联桂冠，其中少帅吕钦两战皆捷，战绩骄人。现评注两盘介绍如下：","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"在中炮过河车对屏风马这一庞大的布局体系中，“马炮争雄”演绎出丰富多采、层出不穷的布局新姿，往往一个次序的颠倒就能导致不同的布局分支，体现了象棋艺术的千变万化和博大精深。以往后手方采用平炮兑车都在第五回合，即走炮8平9，而是局黑方先补士，的确耐人寻味。虽然结果与老式下法殊途同归，但它却增加了新的内涵，既可根据对方的进攻意图，或伺机平炮兑车或左马盘河，此外还有象3进5的选择。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2d4","comment":"至此，弈成中炮七路马对屏风马平炮兑车的常见阵势。此外红方另有炮八平九的走法，形成当前流行的五九炮阵势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d5","comment":"如图形势，黑方炮口扑马后中争先，拉开了中盘激战的序幕。细观枰面似曾相识，原来这是早年曾出现过的变化。老式着法为：炮六进三，卒7进1，炮六进三，炮7平4，炮七平三，车8平7，相七进五，象3退5，双方平稳。而今，红改走进车捉炮，用前不久结束的排位赛上出现的新招，且将新火试新茶。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"大兑子已是不可避免，黑弃子冲卒是明智的选择，不能马7进8吃炮(如车1平4，则马六进四，马7进8，兵三进一，红方先手)，因兵三进一，红优。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4c6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2i1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0c0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4i4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9d5","comment":"经过以上交换，红方多子但右马受制，黑方过河卒潜力巨大，孰优孰劣一时难以说清，形成各有顾忌的局面。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i4i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g4","comment":"红退炮软手，不如车七平八积极。另如马七进八，则马6进8，炮三退二，炮7平2，炮三进五，将5进1，炮一退一，炮6进8，仕五退四，炮2平9，红不行。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8c8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c8i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8b8","comment":"黑打马欠细，应卒5进1较为有利，以下红方大致有两种应手：A、车八平五(如炮五进三，将5平6，炮五平九，马4进6，黑抢攻在先)，炮6平2，车五进二，车4平5，黑优。B、炮五平二(如炮五退二，则马4进5，相三进五，炮7退2，红失马)，炮7平8，红车马被牵难有作为，黑方有进马扑槽的先手。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8d7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9g9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5i5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i1g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"ne